@startuml tf_basic_testing
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam SequenceArrowColor black
skinparam useBetaStyle true

title Basic Testing User Flow

actor "User" as User
participant "CLI" as CLI
participant "Test Framework" as TF
participant "Executor" as Executor
participant "Analyzer" as Analyzer
participant "Reporter" as Reporter

User -> CLI: Define test configuration\n(JSON config file)
note right: Specifies apps, tools, LLM settings

User -> CLI: Execute tests
CLI -> TF: Initialize framework
TF -> TF: Validate configuration
TF -> Executor: Start execution
Executor -> Executor: Run tests with specified\ntools and configurations

loop For each test case
  Executor -> Executor: Set up environment
  Executor -> Executor: Execute test
  Executor -> Executor: Collect results
end

Executor -> TF: Return execution results
TF -> Analyzer: Process raw results
Analyzer -> Analyzer: Calculate metrics
Analyzer -> Analyzer: Identify patterns
Analyzer -> TF: Return analysis results

TF -> Reporter: Generate reports
Reporter -> Reporter: Format results
Reporter -> CLI: Return summary

CLI -> User: Display test summary
note right: Coverage, unique screens, etc.

User -> CLI: Request detailed analysis
CLI -> TF: Request analysis
TF -> Analyzer: Perform detailed analysis
Analyzer -> CLI: Return analysis results
CLI -> User: Display detailed analysis

@enduml